# Lab + Product workspace

When **CCLI-Lab-And-Product.code-workspace** is open (two roots in **one repo**):

| Folder name | Path | Role |
|-------------|------|------|
| **CCLI Lab** | Repo root | Conformance, DUT deploy, `lab/`, `knowledge-base/`, **`apps/ccli`** → **`ccli_main`** |
| **CCLI Product** | `product/apps/ccli` | SK0153 **`program/`**, **`ccli_program`**, entry **`program/main.c`** |

**RAG:** Run sync/ingest from **repo root** only (`scripts/sync-ccli-corpus-to-telematry.ps1`, `scripts/ingest-product-deploy-rag.ps1`).

**Shared code:** Port `core/`, `adapters/`, `services/` between `apps/ccli` and `product/apps/ccli` deliberately. **`third_party`** is one junction — `scripts/link-product-third-party.ps1`.

Guide: `lab/WORKSPACE_LAB_AND_PRODUCT.md` · `product/README.md`
